-/* division and remainder. 
-   
-   rnd_mode is the rounding mode for the quotient. The additional
-   rounding mode BF_RND_EUCLIDIAN is supported.
-
-   'q' is an integer. 'r' is rounded with prec and flags (prec can be
-   BF_PREC_INF).
